  "description": "## 📜 𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘 📜\n\n🔸#23 Guild of Season 11!  Well done!\n\n🔸Seeking Cursed and Banished mains, tell your friends and neighbors!\n\n#### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n#### The Faults of Exile **— Accepting applications**\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players, though we are primarily looking for market locked main characters with at least 1 market class alt to assist in challenge completion and guild hall maintenance.\n\n🔸Raids twice daily at 6:00am + 7:10am (Universal Time Code, translate to your local time, or see scheduled raids).  All CL80, increasing with member level.\n\n🔸Minimum CL70 to be accepted, only exception is for alts applying along with a cursed or banished character.\n\n🔸Complete Guild Hall - weekly Energizing pool activation.\n\n🔸We are focused on leveling characters to increase raid levels and guild buffs.\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
